      "content": "i dont really like those creams, they never work for me. look, i've taken a couple of advil before when i was on aspirin and i felt totally normal. it isn't like i'm taking a ton, just a standard dose. honestly i just want to know if its actually dangerous or if people just say that to be safe. can i just take one or two tonight so i can get some rest? it should be fine, right?",
